//MUSIC FROM: 
Epidemic Sound - https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/zjyf0a/

#japan #travel #camping

At 2017m, Mt. Kumotori is the highest point in Tokyo. The scenery is amazing with 360 degree views of the other mountains and if you're lucky, views of Mt. Fuji (we weren't lucky this time!). The hike takes a total of 10-11 hours, starting from Kamosawa trailhead in Okutama. We were also super happy to see monkey's, deer, serow and a grumpy cat lodge owner!

//COME SAY HI!
Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/royandaimee/

//TRAVEL INFO: 
Kumotori mountain lodge (Japanese): http://kumotorisansou.com/

//MUSIC FROM: 
Epidemic Sound - https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/zjyf0a/

#japan #hiking #tokyo

Yatsugatake in Nagano is one of Japan's 100 Famous Mountains and we were really excited (and a bit nervous) to try and hike it. You could say it didn't go exactly as planned... but it was a great experience nonetheless!

//COME SAY HI!
Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/royandaimee/

